  "pli-tv-pvr2.16:1.1": "kāyasaṃsaggaṃ sādiyanapaccayā kati āpattiyo āpajjati. ",
  "pli-tv-pvr2.16:1.2": "kāy. sād. pañca āpattiyo āpajjati, ",
  "pli-tv-pvr2.16:1.3": "avassutā . . . (see ",
  "pli-tv-pvr2.16:1.4": "chap.10) . . . ",
  "pli-tv-pvr2.16:1.5": "",
  "pli-tv-pvr2.16:1.6": "",
  "pli-tv-pvr2.16:1.7": "aṅgulipatodake pācittiyaṃ. ",
  "pli-tv-pvr2.16:1.8": "kāyasaṃsaggaṃ sādiyanapaccayā imā pañca āpattiyo āpajjati. ",
  "pli-tv-pvr2.16:2.1": "tā āpattiyo catunnaṃ vipattīnaṃ kati . . . (see ",
  "pli-tv-pvr2.16:2.2": "",
  "pli-tv-pvr2.16:2.3": "I,8) . . . ",
  "pli-tv-pvr2.16:2.4": "",
  "pli-tv-pvr2.16:2.5": "katīhi samathehi sammanti. ",
  "pli-tv-pvr2.16:2.6": "tā āpattiyo catunnaṃ vipattīnaṃ dve vipattiyo bhajanti ",
  "pli-tv-pvr2.16:2.7": "siyā sīlavipattiṃ siyā ācāravipattiṃ, ",
  "pli-tv-pvr2.16:2.8": "sattannaṃ āpattikkhandhānaṃ pañcahi āpattikkhandhehi saṃgahitā ",
  "pli-tv-pvr2.16:2.9": "siyā pārājikāpattikkhandhena siyā saṃghādisesāpattikkhandhena siyā thullaccayāpattikkhandhena siyā pācittiyāpattikkhandhena siyā dukkaṭāpattikkhandhena, ",
  "pli-tv-pvr2.16:2.10": "channaṃ āpattisamuṭṭhānānaṃ ekena . . . (I,8) . . . ",
  "pli-tv-pvr2.16:2.11": "",
  "pli-tv-pvr2.16:2.12": "",
  "pli-tv-pvr2.16:2.13": "",
  "pli-tv-pvr2.16:2.14": "tiṇavatthārakena ca. --la--. ",
  "pli-tv-pvr2.16:3.1": "dadhiṃ viññāpetvā bhuñjanapaccayā kati . . . ",
  "pli-tv-pvr2.16:3.2": "dve āpattiyo āpajjati . . . ",
