  "pli-tv-pvr2.16:4.17": "tiṇavatthārakena cā 'ti. ||16|| ",
  "pli-tv-pvr2.16:5.1": "",
  "pli-tv-pvr2.16:5.2": "samuccayavāraṃ niṭṭhitaṃ aṭṭhamaṃ. ",
  "pli-tv-pvr2.16:5.3": "",
  "pli-tv-pvr2.16:6.1": "Bhikkhunīvibhaṅge soḷasa mahābhedā niṭṭhitā. "
